Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"v77_hh7gsbpSpjlzSKeq5w","review_id":"UgvrQxwEGo042zWvSrswow","date":"2010-08-02T17:59:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9409956932067871,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! 80's night on Thursday is usually what I show up for, because it's a big mixed bag of locals, college douchebags, adventurous tourists, and service industry folks all drinkin for cheap and dancing. The decor is beautiful, the staff is quick to make drinks, and most of the shows that I have seen here sound great acoustically. The only issues I have are that a few years ago, bigger names were booked at this venue, and the cost to get in the door is sometimes quite a lot. I might take a chance on a band I have never heard of if the door was, say, $10 instead of $15 and up."},{"business_id":"v77_hh7gsbpSpjlzSKeq5w","review_id":"fRXsNzYMqJyPVHjfQ4jQqg","date":"2011-01-18T18:54:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9363831281661987,"text_excerpt":"It's a bar! It's a theatre! One Eyed Jack's has everything. This place has regular burlesque shows as well as comedy shows and live music. They have 80's night on Thursdays starting at 10 and the it is by far one of the most popular weekly events in the city and the place gets packed. The drinks are pretty cheap, by quarter standards, and the people here are always nice. Great place to hang out if you are an \"artsy\" type, as you are sure to meet someone here that you have something in common with."},{"business_id":"v77_hh7gsbpSpjlzSKeq5w","review_id":"wOVImuNpCiPNiCtfbsdfuQ","date":"2018-01-04T23:05:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9340007305145264,"text_excerpt":"After seeing Boyfriend play New Year's Eve here this year, I have solidified this as one of my top 3 favorite music venues in New Orleans and my absolute favorite place to catch a show in the French Quarter. It's the perfect size - a step up from a super intimate dive bar show, but not a gigantic auditorium either. I especially enjoy that the front room is simply a dive bar perfect for enjoying a few drinks before the show starts. For this reason, I do often arrive right when doors open to grab a seat here. In the back in the venue part, I appreciate the floor being multiple levels. As a shorter person, I try to grab a spot on the first step up so I can see over most people's heads. There..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"v77_hh7gsbpSpjlzSKeq5w","photo_id":"iTetfVP3NobIqmrjFF0f5Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/iTetfVP3NobIqmrjFF0f5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9029701352119446},{"business_id":"v77_hh7gsbpSpjlzSKeq5w","photo_id":"q5XqlBI5qwCqfdi0MUUhpw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/q5XqlBI5qwCqfdi0MUUhpw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8736966848373413},{"business_id":"v77_hh7gsbpSpjlzSKeq5w","photo_id":"yiTVR_Zb-9NoroOtbQNgYg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/yiTVR_Zb-9NoroOtbQNgYg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8552477359771729},{"business_id":"v77_hh7gsbpSpjlzSKeq5w","photo_id":"ZXsqdTNHSqxBxCXcbmOiLA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ZXsqdTNHSqxBxCXcbmOiLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8306682705879211},{"business_id":"v77_hh7gsbpSpjlzSKeq5w","photo_id":"JFTELPGY-JZ0-F5G4A_Erg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JFTELPGY-JZ0-F5G4A_Erg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8081724047660828}]},"notebook_case":null}
